AGPL section 13 (network use)
-----------------------------

If a modified version of this software is made available to users over a
network, its complete corresponding source code must be offered to those
users. This obligation applies to this repository and to anything that
includes its source. Since the merge, this directory is `agent/` inside the
browser repository, which is AGPL-3.0-or-later as a whole, so the obligation
covers the whole browser source as well.

